# research.evidence (seeds-14 §2 macro) — the Labo notebook's chunks in evidence order. A chunk is a note-family
# entry on the research bench; this is the evidence projection of that bench's chunks (superseded retained).
# Coarser than the Set primitives, so it is a MACRO — never a kernel handler. Forward to the bench op.
# Invoke: macro.run name=research.evidence bench=<labo> —  (not , which macro.run reserves).
#
#!params bench,limit=500
research.note.timeline name="$bench" order=evidence limit="$limit"
